GoSFV
=====

GoSFV is a Go port of SharpSFV (https://github.com/Wishwanderer/SharpSFV),
which is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.

SharpSFV is the original work: its architecture, checksum formats, legacy
CRC-32 endian handling and command-line behavior informed this port. GoSFV
reimplements those behaviors in Go and adds a native MyGo interface.

Third-party components:

- MyGo 0.9.0, MIT license, https://github.com/egoist/mygo
- zeebo/xxh3, BSD-2-Clause, https://github.com/zeebo/xxh3
- golang.org/x/sys, BSD-3-Clause, https://golang.org/x/sys
- golang.org/x/image, BSD-3-Clause, https://golang.org/x/image
- schollz/progressbar/v3, MIT, https://github.com/schollz/progressbar
- mitchellh/colorstring, MIT, https://github.com/mitchellh/colorstring
- rivo/uniseg, MIT, https://github.com/rivo/uniseg
- mattn/go-runewidth, MIT, https://github.com/mattn/go-runewidth
- chengxilo/virtualterm, MIT, https://github.com/chengxilo/virtualterm

GoSFV itself is distributed under GPL-3.0. See LICENSE.
